	quests: [
		{
			dependencies: ["51B9A72C19F84F0E"]
			description: [
				"The last three parts can also be used as overlays"
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"An electric motor is a device that converts electrical energy into mechanical energy. Its working principle is based on electromagnetic induction. When current passes through the coil of the motor, a force is generated in the magnetic field. This force causes the rotor of the motor to rotate, thereby driving the load to work. Electric motors are widely used in a variety of industrial, commercial and household appliances."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"An electric piston is an electrically driven reciprocating device that converts the rotational motion of an electric motor into linear reciprocating motion. Such devices can be used in various applications such as compressors, pneumatic actuators, robotic arms, etc."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"A robotic arm is a mechanical device that mimics the functions of a human arm. It is usually composed of a series of links and joints and is capable of performing a range of complex movements, including rotation, bending and extension. Robotic arms can be programmed or remotely controlled to perform a variety of tasks such as handling, assembly, welding, spray painting, measurement, and exploration."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"A conveyor belt is a type of transportation machinery used to move materials or products from one location to another. It consists of one or more continuous belt-like structures rotating around two rollers that serve as drive and support points. The conveyor belt can run horizontally, tilted or vertically to suit different handling needs."
			]
			id: "2D6BB32B642AE8BA"
			rewards: [
